 to have found someone who gets them, strengthening their bond.\n  - cousin's wedding: Sam shared a picture from their cousin's wedding, described as super special. Evan shared news of their own marriage to their partner and family support.\n  - Evan: Evan's partner understood his accidental damage to rose bushes. He also enjoys yoga for stress/flexibility and rewatching The Godfather; he previously drank too much with friends.\n  - Evan: Evan recently bought a new Prius that broke down, causing stress. Evan is also considering trying yoga for stress relief and flexibility.\n  - Evan's partner: Evan's partner and Evan announced their marriage to their extended family, receiving much love and support. The partner was previously in a minor accident.\n  - peaceful moments: Evan mentioned enjoying peaceful moments after a minor accident that slightly affected sharing news about his marriage with work friends.\n  - Evan: Evan apologized to his partner for a drunken night and for accidentally damaging rose bushes, promising to be more careful. He is now looking for low-impact exercises.\n  - Evan: Evan expressed being in love at first sight with a woman from Canada, feeling a spark and believing in their connection.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam that his partner was not thrilled but understood an accident involving rose bushes; he plans to be more careful and enjoys small moments outdoors.\n  - Evan: Evan mentioned a minor accident that dampened telling work friends about getting married; they have been very supportive.\n  - Evan: Evan congratulated Sam on becoming a Weight Watchers coach, finding it exciting and rewarding.\n  - Evan: Evan drank too much, had a pee accident near some roses, and apologized to Sam for the embarrassing incident.\n  - Evan: Evan mentioned his son had an accident last Tuesday after falling off his bike and is now doing better. He recently finished a contemporary figurative painting emphasizing emotional state.\n  - Evan: Evan's son hurt his ankle i