ring significant joy and companionship to his life. He believes that pets provide comfort and are always there for us.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew believes that pets feel like family (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes that pets bring significant joy (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes that nature makes pets happy. (event_time: 2023-06-13T17:23:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes that the animals at the pet shelter are special and full of love. (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Andrew perceives Audrey's dogs as being well loved (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Pets bring lots of joy and companionship to Andrew's life. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes dogs are always there for us. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew's furry friend is his companion (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks the dogs are cute (event_time: 2023-10-01T19:09:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks it must be great for Audrey to have furry friends. (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Andrew has many furry friends. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew loves animals. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Pets provide comfort to people like Andrew when needed (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Andrew shows that he cares a ton about his pets through small things. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew agrees that pets can improve people's lives. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew agrees that dogs are aw