e was interested in the atmosphere of a rock concert in Boston last weekend, subsequent to Calvin's album release party.\n  - concerts: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean and values concerts for the connection between artist and crowd. Calvin watches concerts for inspiration and industry learning.\n  - Dave: Dave's band had a fun rehearsal session last night. Last weekend, Dave attended a rock concert in Boston. Dave is also praised by Calvin for fixing cars.\n  - touring: Calvin started touring with Frank Ocean and is enjoying the amazing energy and connection on stage during performances.\n  - mark: Calvin mentioned that every 'mark' and strum holds a story when discussing his performance on a big stage.\n  - musicians: Calvin performed in Boston and is now supporting ambitious young musicians, viewing it as passing the torch to keep music alive.\n  - live music: Dave expressed that live music is the best and wished Calvin well on tour.\n  - fame: Calvin, inspired by a friend attending his performance, reflected on how relationships and being around certain people spark feelings from when he and friends talked about getting famous as teenagers.\n  - Japanese garden: Calvin shot a beautiful picture in a Japanese garden and described it as a peaceful and serene spot he wants others to check out.\n  - headliner: Calvin asked Dave who the headliner was at an event where Dave took an awesome picture, noting the crowd looked excited and the stage was incredible.\n  - the tour: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean, finding the performance energizing with great crowd connection. He acknowledges fame presents challenges in balancing his job and personal life.\n  - Frank Ocean: Calvin is on tour with Frank Ocean. Calvin finds the tour awesome but occasionally overwhelming due to many demands, yet pushes on.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1971,"context_chars":7883,"retrieval_duration":0.2448112964630127,"response_duration":2.3464889526367188,"total_duration":2.59130024909973